# GitHub blocks any git-tracked file over 100MB — DeepScan.msi (265MB) and
# DeepScan.dmg (now 359MB, since bundling CLIP's text encoder) both have
# to live as release assets only (see `gh release upload`), never a commit.
# The Mac/Windows download buttons on the site link straight to the app
# repo's own GitHub Release now — these copies here are only for this
# repo's own release (`gh release upload`), not served by the site itself.
downloads/DeepScan.msi
downloads/DeepScan.dmg

